{
  "name": "Vox · My Transcriber",
  "short_name": "Vox",
  "id": "/",
  "description": "Think out loud. Vox thinks with you, and yes, it transcribes too. Voice notes with AI lenses: summaries, action plans, maps. No account. Your notes are stored on your device. Bring your own AI key.",
